{
  "_comment": "变量可见范围的共享用例表（2026-10-14）：Python 侧 tests/contract/test_variable_scope_visibility.py 与 JS 侧 scripts/check_scope_visibility.mjs 跑同一份数据——两侧各自实现一遍「哪些变量在这个节点可见」是这类功能的经典漂移点。expected* 是**手写**的期望（不是从实现里导出的），所以它对两侧都是独立判据；Python 侧另有一条用编译器当裁判的逐格对账（visible_scope 的判定 == 编译能否通过）。",
  "_rule": "当前节点不能引用【自身】或【之后】节点声明的变量；循环/错误变量只在词法嵌套内可见。遍历顺序与 compiler.WorkflowCompiler.compile 的 walk() 一致：children 顺序 / if 的 then→else / try 的 body→catch。",
  "workflow": {
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "id": "scope.cases",
    "name": "scope cases",
    "inputs": { "threshold": "x" },
    "root": {
      "type": "sequence",
      "id": "root",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "a1",
          "command": "data.setVar",
          "with": { "varName": "alpha", "value": "1" }
        },
        {
          "type": "if",
          "id": "iff",
          "condition": { "op": "eq", "left": "1", "right": "1" },
          "then": [
            {
              "type": "action",
              "id": "a2",
              "command": "data.setVar",
              "with": { "varName": "thenvar", "value": "1" }
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "action",
              "id": "a3",
              "command": "data.setVar",
              "with": { "varName": "elsevar", "value": "1" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "forEach",
          "id": "loop",
          "items": [1, 2],
          "item_var": "row",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "action",
              "id": "a4",
              "command": "data.setVar",
              "with": { "varName": "innervar", "value": "1" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "try",
          "id": "try",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "action",
              "id": "a5",
              "command": "data.setVar",
              "with": { "varName": "tryvar", "value": "1" }
            }
          ],
          "catch": [
            {
              "type": "action",
              "id": "a6",
              "command": "data.setVar",
              "with": { "varName": "catchvar", "value": "1" }
            }
          ],
          "error_var": "err"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "a7",
          "command": "data.setVar",
          "with": { "varName": "finalvar", "value": "1" }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "nodeId": "a1",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "首个节点：什么都还没有",
      "variables": [],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": []
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a2",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 1 }, { "key": "then", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "then 分支：看得见 a1 的声明，看不见自己的 thenvar",
      "variables": ["alpha"],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": []
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a3",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 1 }, { "key": "else", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "★ else 分支看得见 then 里声明的 thenvar —— 编译器先序遍历放行，菜单同口径",
      "variables": ["alpha", "thenvar"],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": []
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a4",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 2 }, { "key": "children", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "循环体内：loop.row 可见（item_var 显式命名）",
      "variables": ["alpha", "thenvar", "elsevar"],
      "loopVars": ["row"],
      "errorVars": []
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a5",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 3 }, { "key": "children", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "try 体内：循环结束 ⇒ loop.row 不再可见；error_var 也还不能用",
      "variables": ["alpha", "thenvar", "elsevar", "innervar"],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": []
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a6",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 3 }, { "key": "catch", "index": 0 }],
      "note": "★ catch 里看得见 try 体声明的 tryvar（同 else 那条），并且 err 可用",
      "variables": ["alpha", "thenvar", "elsevar", "innervar", "tryvar"],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": ["err"]
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "a7",
      "path": [{ "key": "children", "index": 4 }],
      "note": "末节点：前面六个都看得见，catchvar 也算已声明过；err 出了 catch 即不可用",
      "variables": [
        "alpha",
        "thenvar",
        "elsevar",
        "innervar",
        "tryvar",
        "catchvar"
      ],
      "loopVars": [],
      "errorVars": []
    }
  ]
}
